013400
013500 COPY MCLASS   IN COPYLIB.
013600
014900 COPY DBCSACCT  IN COPYLIB.
015000
015100 COPY DATAB     IN COPYLIB.
015200
015800 01 ARG-VALUES.
015900     05  PO-ARG                   PIC X(10)  VALUE SPACES.
016000     05  MATL-ARG                 PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.
016100     05  CLASS-ARG                PIC X(4)   VALUE SPACES.
016200
